### Step 2: Add the Auto-Polling useEffect
Right below your existing useEffect(() => { fetchMyBatches(); }, [fetchMyBatches]); (around line 405), add this new hook. It will watch your rows, and if it sees an 'S' batch, it will silently poll the server every 5 seconds until it's done!
